{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36462","headline":"春夜赤水驿旅怀 · 罗邺","name":"春夜赤水驿旅怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一星残烛照离堂，失计游心归渺茫。\n不自寻思无道路，爲谁辛苦竞时光。\n九衢春色休回首，半夜溪声正梦乡。\n却羡去年买山侣，月斜渔艇倚潇湘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}